      "id": "claim_6018843f3d8a4e4299c64c44419daa21",
      "statement": "eslint.config.mjs enforces the import direction with import/no-restricted-paths zones that forbid raw database.types.ts outside a module's data/, shared/ importing modules/ or app/, modules/ importing app/, and one module's data/ being imported from another module — and because each data/-privacy zone targets `modules/!(<d>)/**`, a module folder missing from the file's `domains` array has no enforced boundary at all.",
